      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assiniboia%2C_Saskatchewan"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The town’s growth was so rapid that it incorporated as a village on Dec 22, 1912 and became a town in 1913.",
